posing creatures is usually not a good plan. Don't be afraid to take some early damage while you get set up.\r\n<br>\r\nYour suite of burn spells is both formidable and versatile. Many of these spells can target a creature or a player, so you'll be able to either remove problematic enemy forces or simply finish off your opponent. Flames of the Firebrand and Turn // Burn are great ways to clear out an early rush, and Battlefield Thaumaturge makes them brutally efficient if you're going after multiple creatures.\r\n<br><br>Each event deck contains a preconstructed 60-card deck, 10 rares, and a 15-card sideboard."}]},{"productId":80850,"name":"Journey Into Nyx - Event Deck Display (6)","cleanName":"Journey Into Nyx Event Deck Display 6","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/80850_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":1277,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/80850/magic-journey-into-nyx-journey-into-nyx-event-deck-display-6","modifiedOn":"2014-03-12T13:12:47.603","imageCount":0,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":"2014-05-23T00:00:00","note":null},"extendedData":[]},{"productId":80853,"name":"Defeat a God Challenge Deck","cleanName":"Defeat a God Challenge Deck","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/80853_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":1277,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/80853/magic-journey-into-nyx-defeat-a-god-challenge-deck","modifiedOn":"2015-07-17T19:06:36.563","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[]},{"productId":80857,"name":"Journey Into Nyx Prerelease - Forged in Glory","cleanName":"Journey Into Nyx Prerelease Forged in Glory","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/80857_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":1277,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/80857/magic-journey-into-nyx-journey-into-nyx-prerelease-forged-in-glory","modifiedOn":"2019-09-24T20:16:08.15","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"n